   "id": "merge-intervals",
   "num": 2,
   "leet_id": 56,
   "title_cn": "合并区间",
   "title_en": "Merge Intervals",
   "difficulty": "中等",
   "category": "array",
   "tags": [
    "数组",
    "排序"
   ],
   "statement": {
    "desc": [
     "以数组 `intervals` 表示若干个区间的集合，其中单个区间为 `intervals[i] = [starti, endi]`。请你合并所有重叠的区间，并返回一个不重叠的区间数组，该数组需恰好覆盖输入中的所有区间。"
    ],
    "examples": [
     {
      "input": "intervals = [[1,3],[2,6],[8,10],[15,18]]",
      "output": "[[1,6],[8,10],[15,18]]",
      "explain": "[1,3] 与 [2,6] 重叠，合并为 [1,6]"
     },
     {
      "input": "intervals = [[1,4],[4,5]]",
      "output": "[[1,5]]",
      "explain": "[1,4] 与 [4,5] 可视为重叠区间"
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "1 <= intervals.length <= 10^4",
     "intervals[i].length == 2",
     "0 <= starti <= endi <= 10^4"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "**按左端点排序**后，重叠的区间必然相邻。维护「当前合并区间 `last`」，逐个考察后续区间：",
     "若新区间的起点 `start ≤ last.end`，说明有重叠（或相接），把 `last` 的终点扩展为 `max(last.end, end)`；",
     "否则无重叠，把 `last` 存入结果、以新区间开启新的合并段。排序 O(n log n) + 一遍扫描 O(n)。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "将 `intervals` 按起点升序排序",
     "`last = intervals[0]`，`merged = []`",
     "对每个后续区间 `[s, e]`：若 `s <= last[1]`，`last[1] = max(last[1], e)`（扩展）",
     "否则把 `last` 追加进 `merged`，`last = [s, e]`",
     "收尾时把最后一个 `last` 也追加进 `merged`，返回 `merged`"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(n log n)",
     "space": "O(log n)（排序栈）"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def merge(self, intervals: List[List[int]]) -> List[List[int]]:\n        intervals.sort(key=lambda x: x[0])   # 按左端点排序\n        merged = []\n        for iv in intervals:\n            if merged and iv[0] <= merged[-1][1]:   # 与上一段重叠\n                merged[-1][1] = max(merged[-1][1], iv[1])\n            else:\n                merged.append(list(iv))\n        return merged\n"
   },
